    "html": "<p>Star A has luminosity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span> and radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>. Star B has luminosity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8L\"></span> and radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{R}{4}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the ratio <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textup{surface temperature of star B}}{\\textup{surface temperature of star A}}\\,?\"></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\\sqrt[4]{8}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\sqrt[4]{2}}{4}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
